# LLDB settings for debugging DSH.
#
# The emulator uses signals as ordinary machinery, not as faults:
#   SIGUSR1  wakes guest threads and interrupts blocking syscalls
#            (that is why a paused debugger lands in __psynch_cvwait under
#             sys_wait4 — the guest is simply waiting)
#   SIGTTIN  arrives from terminal handling
#   SIGPIPE  arrives when a guest process closes a pipe
# Without this, Xcode stops on each of them and looks like a crash.
process handle -n false -p true -s false SIGUSR1 SIGTTIN SIGPIPE
